      "description": "HSG - Uni SG - Mid-Career Researchers Privacy settings We use cookies/targeting and process personal data to measure results and/or tailor the content of our website. Because we value your privacy, we ask for your permission. You can change/adjust your consent at any time in the \"Privacy settings\". Accept all cookies Accept required cookies Settings Data Protection Declaration Copyright & Disclaimer Privacy settings × Required cookies TYPO3 Consent Management Solution Functional cookies and pixels Google Analytics Crazy Egg Marketing cookies and pixels LinkedIn Meta Pixel Google Ads / Google Marketing Platform TikTok Pinterest Reddit Application related cookies Vimeo Youtube iFrame Other Applications Google Maps Required cookies This concerns: this consent menu incl. proof of consent TYPO3-Session Cookie (file transferred to the user's computer). Cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be deactivated. However, you can set your browser to block these cookies or to notify you of these cookies. However, some areas of the website will then not function or only function to a limited extent. For further information, please refer to the HSG data protection declaration of the: HSG – Website HSG – Your information request and voluntary contributions TYPO3 TYPO3 uses so-called session cookies (\"cookies\") by default. A TYPO3 cookie is a small data file that is transferred to the visitor's computer, but cannot identify the visitor personally. It only stores the browser installed on the visitor's computer, the visitor's activities, and the user's name and e-mail address when the user fills out a comment form. Consent Management Solution When you visit the website, \"cookies\" may be installed on your computer's hard drive for the sole purpose of making the website more responsive to the needs of returning visitors. These mini-files or cookies are not used to monitor the visitor's browsing behaviour on other websites. Internet browsers allow you to block the use of cookies. You will receive a warning when a cookie is installed or a notification that the cookies can then be removed from your hard drive. Please refer to the help function of your internet browser. Functional cookies and pixels These cookies enable the website to provide enhanced functionality and personalisation. They are set by third-party providers whose services the HSG uses on the pages of its domain. For further information, please refer to the HSG data protection declaration of the: HSG – Third Parties Google Analytics Google Analytics is a web analytics service provided by Alphabet Inc / Google LLC / Google Ireland Limited / Google Inc for the purpose of analysing how users use the website. Specifically: Reporting on website activity for the HSG Provision of other services associated with the use of the website and the Internet. After the cookie has been saved on your computer, personal data is collected: IP address / abbreviated IP address Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://policies.google.com/privacy Information on the third party can be found at: about.google Crazy Egg Crazy Egg is a website optimisation tool to obtain statistics about user behaviour on a website. Once the cookie is stored on your computer, it can help optimise the website for your use. In-formation is stored which provides information about where you have clicked: where you clicked how long you stayed on individual pages of the domain The following are transmitted to Crazy Egg: the first three bytes of your IP address the click coordinates other parameters provided by your web browser Information on data protection, retention period, storage locations and third parties can be found at: www.crazyegg.com/ Marketing cookies and pixels These cookies may be set by advertising partners. They may be used by these companies to profile your interests and show you relevant ads on other websites. This is based on a unique identification of your browser and internet device. For further information, please refer to the HSG data protection declaration of the: HSG – Third Parties LinkedIn It is used by LinkedIn Corporation: Conversion tracking technology Retargeting function This technology can be used to serve personalised ads on LinkedIn to users of this website. Furthermore, it is possible to create anonymous reports on the performance of the advertise-ments and information on website interaction. For this purpose, the LinkedIn In-Sight tag is integrated on this website, which establishes a connection to the LinkedIn server if you are logged into your LinkedIn account at the same time. Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://www.linkedin.com/legal/privacy-policy Information on the third party can be found at: https://www.linkedin.com Meta Pixel This is a tracking technology of Facebook Inc. / Facebook Ireland Limited, which is placed as a pixel in the browser and used for: Marketing Retargeting Tracking Analysis Advertising The following personal data is collected: Facebook user ID Browser information Usage data Non-sensitive custom data Referrer URL Pixel ID User behaviour Advertisements viewed Interactions with advertisements, services and products Marketing information Viewed content IP address Device information Marketing campaign success Geographical location Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://www.facebook.com/privacy/explanation Information on the third party can be found at: https://www.facebook.com Google Ads / Google Marketing Platform It is a service of Alphabet Inc. / Google LLC / Google Ireland Limited / Google Inc. for the pur pose of internet advertising, which allows advertisers to place ads in Google's search engine results as well as in the Google advertising network. The purpose of Google Ads / Google Marketing Platforms is the insertion of interest-relevant advertising on the websites of third-party companies and in the search engine results of the Google search engine, as well as the insertion of third-party advertising. A so-called conversion cookie is stored by Google in the information technology system of the data subject. In connection with AdWords and personal data, such as an IP address, Google: understands whether a data subject has completed or cancelled a purchase of goods compiles visit statistics determines the success or failure of AdWords ads and optimizes them Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://www.google.de/intl/de/policies/privacy/ Information on the third party can be found at: https://about.google/ TikTok This is a code from TikTok Information Technologies UK Limited which is implemented as a pixel on the website for the purpose of displaying targeted and personalised advertising to us-ers and to create interest-based user profiles. A connection is established to TikTok servers to collect the following personal data: IP address E-mail address Unit ID Device type Operating System In addition, behaviour on websites can be tracked, e.g. for measuring the effectiveness of ad placements. Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://www.tiktok.com/legal/page/eea/new-privacy-policy/en-EN Information on the third party can be found at: https://www.tiktok.com/ Pinterest Pinterest is a service provided by Pinterest Inc., USA, which is integrated into the website as a pixel, widget, or pin button for marketing and analysis purposes relating to users. A connection is established to Pinterest servers in order to collect the following personal data: Technical data: IP address Device information Browser information Operating system Screen resolution Language settings Usage data: Date/time of access Pages viewed Referrer URL (e.g., coming from Pinterest) Click behavior Cookie/tracking data: Unique Ids Session Ids Possibly hashed email address (if known) Location data (derived from IP or device information) Interaction data (content that is shared, pinned, or clicked on) Information on data protection, retention periods, and storage locations, including the US, can be found at: https://policy.pinterest.com/en/privacy-policy Reddit Functions of the Reddit platform are integrated into the website (the so-called Reddit Pixel). The provider is: Reddit Inc., 548 Market St #16093, San Francisco, CA 94104, USA. Reddit is a service provided by Reddit company, which is embedded as a pixel on the website of the University of St.Gallen. To optimise our content for your needs, personal and behavioural data are collected and processed in analytics tools such as Google Analytics, in particular: IP address Browser and device data Date and time of access Referrer URL (our website) Information about your use of embedded content Existing Reddit cookies or tracking IDs Reddit may use these data to provide embedded content, analyse user behaviour, display personalised content or advertising, and ensure the security of the platform. Further information about the purpose and scope of data collection by Reddit, the storage period and the storage locations in the United States can be found at: Reddit Privacy Policy Application related cookies These cookies are required by third party regulations when users voluntarily apply the relevant element. For further information, please refer to the HSG data protection declaration of the: HSG – Third Parties Vimeo This is a service provided by Vimeo LLC for the purpose of displaying video content. A cookie is placed in the browser and used to collect the following personal data: Browser information Browser language Browser type Cookie information Device information Device operating system Information from third party sources IP address Pages visited Referring URL Information users provide on the website Search queries Geographical location Retrieved content Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://vimeo.com/privacy Information on the third party can be found at: https://vimeo.com/ Youtube This is a service provided by Alphabet Inc. / Google LLC / Google Ireland Limited / Google Inc. for the purpose of displaying video content. A cookie is placed in the browser if the privacy-friendly mode is not activated and is used to collect the following personal data: Device information IP address Referring URL Retrieved videos Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en Information on the third party can be found at: https://about.google/ iFrame Fremde Inhalte können per iFrame in der Seite integriert sein. Other Applications For further information, please refer to the HSG data protection declaration of the: HSG – Third Parties Google Maps This is an API (\"Application Programming Interface\") for the map service of Alphabet Inc. / Google LLC / Google Ireland Limited / Google Inc. for the purpose of an appealing presentation of the online offer and an easy findability of specified locations. When used, the IP address is collected as a personal data. No cookies are used. Information on data protection, retention period and storage locations can be found at: https://www.google.com/intl/de_de/help/terms_maps/ Information on the third party can be found at: https://about.google/ Cancel Save and close path d=\"m521.23-480-123 123L440-314.23 605.77-480 440-645.77 398.23-603l123 123Zm-41.16 380q-78.84 0-148.21-29.92t-120.68-81.21q-51.31-51.29-81.25-120.63Q100-401.1 100-479.93q0-78.84 29.92-148.21t81.21-120.68q51.29-51.31 120.63-81.25Q401.1-860 479.93-860q78.84 0 148.21 29.92t120.68 81.21q51.31 51.29 81.25 120.63Q860-558.9 860-480.07q0 78.84-29.92 148.21t-81.21 120.68q-51.29 51.31-120.63 81.25Q558.9-100 480.07-100Zm-.07-60q134 0 227-93t93-227q0-134-93-227t-227-93q-